{"candidateAnswer":"Cooking show","evidence":"[D21:4 | 1:43 pm on 14 September, 2022] Nate: Hey Joanna, I'm no writer like you, but something pretty awesome happened. Last Monday I got to teach people vegan ice cream recipes on my own cooking show! It was a bit nerve-wracking to put myself out there, but it was a blast. Plus, I picked up a few new recipes!","itemId":"urn:uuid:fc58d92e-35e0-5e5e-aa4a-fbdc004eae65","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2cb64e2347af1a63435cd71a7d1fb99a516c0784547c3d16e0b1c270cbb1bff4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of show did Nate host where he taught vegan ice cream recipes?","referenceAnswer":"a cooking show","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2cb64e2347af1a63435cd71a7d1fb99a516c0784547c3d16e0b1c270cbb1bff4"}}]}